# S12 — chat mode (live-e2e Phase 1 scenario 12, M1-546).
#
# A non-slash DM reaches the chat agent and gets an LLM response. The reply is
# prose (no deterministic bundle string), so the match is a length floor: every
# progress placeholder ("Working on it...", "Summarizing...", "Done.", …) is
# under 80 chars, a real answer is not. The final body arrives via item EDIT —
# the finalized-union path. Generous timeout: llama.cpp on 4 vCPU takes
# 60-120 s (HANDOFF §Live-run notes).
#
# Host preconditions: 'admin' is registered and past probation (free-form chat
# is probation-locked); the chat LLM is up.

send dm admin What kinds of posts do you aggregate?
expect regex 240000 (?s).{80,}
